# The build context is uploaded to the Docker daemon before a single
# instruction runs. This directory carries go.exe — a 9.3 MB Windows binary a
# linux/amd64 build can never use — which is 99% of the context by size.
#
# The Dockerfile already copies selectively (go.mod, then *.go), so none of
# this ever reached the image. This is about the upload, not the layers:
# 9.4 MB of context becomes about 50 KB.
*.exe
bin/
